			title = "Summary",
			text = [=[Hammerfall stands on the eastern hills of the highlands. After the {link:second-war}Second War{/link} it was one of the {link:internment-camps}internment camps{/link} where the {link:alliance}Alliance{/link} held the beaten orcs. Its cages, stocks and gallows still stand. {link:thrall}Thrall{/link} and {link:orgrim-doomhammer}Orgrim Doomhammer{/link} came to set its prisoners free, and here Doomhammer was struck down from behind by a knight's lance. Years later the orcs came back and made the ruin their own. Today {link:drum-fel}Drum Fel{/link} holds Hammerfall for the {link:horde}Horde{/link}, with {link:darkspear-trolls}Darkspear{/link} trolls, {link:defilers}Forsaken Defilers{/link} and a chief physician of the Horde among his people. {link:trolls}Trolls{/link} and ogres attack its walls without rest.]=],
