		{ type = "target" },
	},
	hint = "Seek the prince who holds the last quarter of Stromgarde.",
	sections = {
		{
			title = "Summary",
			text = [=[Prince Galen Trollbane is the son of {link:thoras-trollbane}King Thoras{/link} and the heir of a fallen throne. He holds the last corner of {link:stromgarde-keep}Stromgarde{/link} that is still his, a district of the old city around its chapel. Behind that chapel his father lies entombed. Galen guards the tomb, and he guards the sword that lies within it.]=],
		},
		{
			title = "Significance",
			text = [=[Galen is the last of the Trollbanes in the highlands, the line of Ignaeus who won the sword {link:trol-kalar}Trol'kalar{/link} against the trolls. To the trolls of the {link:horde}Horde{/link}, his blood is an ancient enemy. To his soldiers, he is all that is left of their king.]=],
		},
		{
			title = "Deeds",
			text = [=[• He sealed his father's tomb with sigils and divided them among the survivors of {link:stromgarde-keep}Stromgarde{/link}.
• He broke the Sigil of {link:thoradin}Thoradin{/link} into pieces and gave them to his defenders to carry.
• He gave the Sigil of {link:arathor}Arathor{/link} to {link:lieutenant-valorcall}Lieutenant Valorcall{/link}, and keeps the Sigil of Trollbane himself.
• He sends the remnant of his cavalry riding across the highlands.]=],
		},
		{
			title = "Unrecorded",
			text = [=[No chronicle of these days records how {link:thoras-trollbane}King Thoras{/link} died, or how his son came to rule in his place.]=],
		},
	},
	chapters = {
		{
			key = "the-divided-sigil",
			title = "The Divided Sigil",
			hint = [=[Learn how the prince of Stromgarde protects his father's tomb.]=],
			unlock = {
				{ type = "quest", id = 640 },
			},
			text = [=[The tomb of {link:thoras-trollbane}King Thoras{/link} cannot be opened by force. Galen bound it with sigils, and he scattered them so that no single fall could lose them all. One went to the {link:syndicate}Syndicate{/link} when {link:stromgarde-keep}Stromgarde{/link} fell. The Sigil of {link:thoradin}Thoradin{/link} he broke into many pieces and shared among his defenders, so that it would have to be taken from many hands.]=],
		},
		{
			key = "the-chapel",
			title = "The Chapel",
			hint = "Seek out the prince in the chapel of the defenders' quarter.",
			unlock = {
				{ type = "quest", id = 644 },
			},
			text = [=[The last sigil hung at the prince's own side, deep within the chapel of the militia's quarter. He was well guarded, and no mean fighter himself. When the {link:darkspear-trolls}Darkspear{/link} hunter {link:zengu}Zengu{/link} at last held the sigil in his hands, he asked only one question: whether the line of Ignaeus Trollbane had been broken.]=],
