			text = [=[The leaders of the attacks had made their lair within {link:stromgarde-keep}Stromgarde{/link}, which Drum Fel called a monument to human weakness. When his fighters came back from the ruins, the pressure on {link:hammerfall}Hammerfall{/link} eased at last. He began to believe his people could thrive in the highlands.]=],
