				{ type = "quest", id = 688 },
			},
			text = [=[When the Rod of Order turned in the Keystone, the ground shook. Myzrael cried out that she was free. She did not mean to face her jailers yet. She would hide, grow strong, and one day make the giants pay for their wardship. When she was ready, she would need to be summoned.]=],
