		{
			title = "Summary",
			text = [=[The Drywhisker are a tribe of {link:kobolds}kobolds{/link} who dig in {link:drywhisker-gorge}Drywhisker Gorge{/link}, in the far north-east of the highlands. They are surveyors and diggers, and among them works a geomancer called Flintdagger who commands fire.]=],
		},
		{
			title = "The Shards",
			text = [=[The Drywhisker are not only miners. Deep in their gorge they guard a cluster of iridescent crystal shards, and they carry with them motes of a strange power. The being who lies bound beneath the highlands calls them allies of the giants who hold her. Three of them walk beside the stone watcher {link:fozruk}Fozruk{/link} himself. No one knows what the giants have given the kobolds for their service, or whether the kobolds even understand whom they serve.]=],
